{"logId": "8e336556-bf3e-41c3-ad12-b003016ea1a8", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——居家", "block_bbox": [165, 141, 455, 172], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[165.0, 141.0], [455.0, 141.0], [455.0, 172.0], [165.0, 172.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、与自身生活水平相匹配的社区居住环境及居民普遍素质，无明显的差异悬殊（平均收入消费水平、综合素质和人文、生活习惯、生活状态等）", "block_bbox": [174, 213, 1016, 266], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[174.0, 213.0], [1016.0, 213.0], [1016.0, 266.0], [174.0, 266.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、购房建议（不计入考评项）", "block_bbox": [176, 273, 416, 296], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[176.0, 273.0], [416.0, 273.0], [416.0, 296.0], [176.0, 296.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（1）购买房子选择大品牌建筑商，建筑品质有保障", "block_bbox": [188, 303, 588, 326], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[188.0, 303.0], [588.0, 303.0], [588.0, 326.0], [188.0, 326.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（2）尽量不选择临街房，减少噪音污染", "block_bbox": [188, 332, 500, 356], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[188.0, 332.0], [500.0, 332.0], [500.0, 356.0], [188.0, 356.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "（3）购房尽量选择中低层、带连廊的楼栋，更有安全保障", "block_bbox": [188, 363, 642, 387], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[188.0, 363.0], [642.0, 363.0], [642.0, 387.0], [188.0, 387.0]]}, {"block_label": "figure_title", "block_content": "[48]", "block_bbox": [573, 716, 611, 738], "block_id": 6, "block_order": null, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[573.0, 716.0], [610.0, 716.0], [610.0, 737.0], [573.0, 737.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "考评奖励标准——居家", "block_bbox": [206, 900, 498, 932], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[206.0, 900.0], [498.0, 900.0], [498.0, 932.0], [206.0, 932.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "五级【4~5分】：有先进的居家理念，放松休闲的心灵港湾。", "block_bbox": [201, 976, 693, 1001], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[201.0, 976.0], [693.0, 976.0], [693.0, 1001.0], [201.0, 1001.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "- 本条释义：有先进的居家理念，家是属于夫妻两个人的，不应该规划老人同住、也不规划孩子18岁后居住，是真正的放松、休闲、自由的空间和心灵港湾。", "block_bbox": [199, 1023, 1051, 1078], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[199.0, 1023.0], [1051.0, 1023.0], [1051.0, 1078.0], [199.0, 1078.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "符合的行为：", "block_bbox": [202, 1121, 320, 1144], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[202.0, 1121.0], [319.0, 1121.0], [319.0, 1143.0], [202.0, 1143.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1、围绕夫妻二人展开、注重居家的功能与实用，仅安排夫妻、孩子的卧室", "block_bbox": [218, 1161, 810, 1184], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[218.0, 1161.0], [810.0, 1161.0], [810.0, 1184.0], [218.0, 1184.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2、长久的居家规划是两个卧室，一个是夫妻二人的，一个是客房、用于临时居住（有保姆的家庭，预留保姆房除外）", "block_bbox": [216, 1191, 1048, 1245], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[216.0, 1191.0], [1048.0, 1191.0], [1048.0, 1245.0], [216.0, 1245.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3、不与老人同住", "block_bbox": [219, 1253, 363, 1276], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[219.0, 1253.0], [362.0, 1253.0], [362.0, 1275.0], [219.0, 1275.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4、不与子女同住（20岁以后）", "block_bbox": [218, 1283, 459, 1306], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[218.0, 1283.0], [459.0, 1283.0], [459.0, 1306.0], [218.0, 1306.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5、与自身贴合、实用的餐厅及其他功能配置", "block_bbox": [219, 1314, 576, 1336], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[219.0, 1314.0], [576.0, 1314.0], [576.0, 1336.0], [219.0, 1336.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "6、家是属于自己的地方，喜欢的人出入", "block_bbox": [219, 1344, 541, 1367], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[219.0, 1344.0], [541.0, 1344.0], [541.0, 1367.0], [219.0, 1367.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "7、能让自己安静、轻松、自由，休憩和涵养自己心灵", "block_bbox": [219, 1375, 647, 1398], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[219.0, 1375.0], [647.0, 1375.0], [647.0, 1398.0], [219.0, 1398.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "8、有保姆的家庭，建立亲近良好、彼此满意幸福的状态", "block_bbox": [219, 1406, 666, 1429], "block_id": 18, "block_order": 18, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[219.0, 1406.0], [666.0, 1406.0], [666.0, 1429.0], [219.0, 1429.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "[49]", "block_bbox": [611, 1477, 649, 1497], "block_id": 19, "block_order": null, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[611.0, 1477.0], [648.0, 1477.0], [648.0, 1496.0], [611.0, 1496.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8191969394683838, "coordinate": [165, 141, 455, 172], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[165.0, 141.0], [455.0, 141.0], [455.0, 172.0], [165.0, 172.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8999679088592529, "coordinate": [174, 213, 1016, 266], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[174.0, 213.0], [1016.0, 213.0], [1016.0, 266.0], 