, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.9024474024772644, "coordinate": [216, 1191, 1048, 1245], "order": 12, "polygon_points": [[216.0, 1191.0], [1048.0, 1191.0], [1048.0, 1245.0], [216.0, 1245.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.806789755821228, "coordinate": [219, 1253, 363, 1276], "order": 13, "polygon_points": [[219.0, 1253.0], [362.0, 1253.0], [362.0, 1275.0], [219.0, 1275.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8156181573867798, "coordinate": [218, 1283, 459, 1306], "order": 14, "polygon_points": [[218.0, 1283.0], [459.0, 1283.0], [459.0, 1306.0], [218.0, 1306.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8222575187683105, "coordinate": [219, 1314, 576, 1336], "order": 15, "polygon_points": [[219.0, 1314.0], [576.0, 1314.0], [576.0, 1336.0], [219.0, 1336.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8199958205223083, "coordinate": [219, 1344, 541, 1367], "order": 16, "polygon_points": [[219.0, 1344.0], [541.0, 1344.0], [541.0, 1367.0], [219.0, 1367.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8038861155509949, "coordinate": [219, 1375, 647, 1398], "order": 17, "polygon_points": [[219.0, 1375.0], [647.0, 1375.0], [647.0, 1398.0], [219.0, 1398.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8155615329742432, "coordinate": [219, 1406, 666, 1429], "order": 18, "polygon_points": [[219.0, 1406.0], [666.0, 1406.0], [666.0, 1429.0], [219.0, 1429.0]]}, {"cls_id": 16, "label": "number", "score": 0.6922779679298401, "coordinate": [611, 1477, 649, 1497], "order": 19, "polygon_points": [[611.0, 1477.0], [648.0, 1477.0], [648.0, 1496.0], [611.0, 1496.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "## 考评奖励标准——居家\n\n2、与自身生活水平相匹配的社区居住环境及居民普遍素质，无明显的差异悬殊（平均收入消费水平、综合素质和人文、生活习惯、生活状态等）\n\n3、购房建议（不计入考评项）\n\n（1）购买房子选择大品牌建筑商，建筑品质有保障\n\n（2）尽量不选择临街房，减少噪音污染\n\n（3）购房尽量选择中低层、带连廊的楼栋，更有安全保障\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\">[48]</div>\n\n\n## 考评奖励标准——居家\n\n五级【4~5分】：有先进的居家理念，放松休闲的心灵港湾。\n\n- 本条释义：有先进的居家理念，家是属于夫妻两个人的，不应该规划老人同住、也不规划孩子18岁后居住，是真正的放松、休闲、自由的空间和心灵港湾。\n\n符合的行为：\n\n1、围绕夫妻二人展开、注重居家的功能与实用，仅安排夫妻、孩子的卧室\n\n2、长久的居家规划是两个卧室，一个是夫妻二人的，一个是客房、用于临时居住（有保姆的家庭，预留保姆房除外）\n\n3、不与老人同住\n\n4、不与子女同住（20岁以后）\n\n5、与自身贴合、实用的餐厅及其他功能配置\n\n6、家是属于自己的地方，喜欢的人出入\n\n7、能让自己安静、轻松、自由，休憩和涵养自己心灵\n\n8、有保姆的家庭，建立亲近良好、彼此满意幸福的状态", "images": {}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//8e336556-bf3e-41c3-ad12-b003016ea1a8/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A13%3A56Z%2F-1%2F%2F8b8a2e75f3fe81841d52d2d60837533e71ea927c0783c254768cb7d4923dc3d2"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//8e336556-bf3e-41c3-ad12-b003016ea1a8/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A13%3A56Z%2F-1%2F%2F413891dc45509d0eb510ee7344b654302bde6a080c7c6a7b1da8fbd4c4df9699"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1190, "height": 1684}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//8e336556-bf3e-41c3-ad12-b003016ea1a8/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T08%3A13%3A56Z%2F-1%2F%2F6ea6b8e8555a7824eacf73b22ce1256f271576cbad72960529b29b6d4798dc8d"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
